WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.638
&gt;&gt; Our CNN primetime exclusive

00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:05.506
interview with the president of

00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:06.807
Ukraine continues right now

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:07.574
with the biggest question of

00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:13.178
all, how does this wherever and?

00:00:13.255 --> 00:00:15.424
As you know the United States

00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:16.692
have been warning China against

00:00:16.692 --> 00:00:17.192
providing lethal weapons to

00:00:17.192 --> 00:00:17.692
Russia.

00:00:17.692 --> 00:00:19.694
Have you been briefed, mister

00:00:19.694 --> 00:00:20.195
president, recently by U.S.

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:20.695
Officials on where this all

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:21.253
stands?

00:00:21.352 --> 00:00:22.219
Do you expect China to take

00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:23.587
that step?

00:00:23.587 --> 00:00:26.624
&gt;&gt; Translator: I would like to

00:00:38.407 --> 00:00:40.475
have all the countries support

00:00:40.742 --> 00:00:41.242
the end of the war.

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:45.581
And on the side of all other

00:00:45.847 --> 00:00:51.787
security directions, which we

00:00:52.054 --> 00:00:55.123
have lack of, and we are

00:00:55.324 --> 00:00:57.125
interested to have China on the

00:00:57.359 --> 00:00:58.794
side of the nuclear safety and

00:00:59.127 --> 00:00:59.627
security.

00:01:02.197 --> 00:01:03.632
The U.S. Does not have much --

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:08.070
we understand that, and how the

00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:11.673
U.S. Will be living with China,

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.141
it is a matter between the U.S.

00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:13.708
And China.

00:01:15.244 --> 00:01:18.413
But when the war starts in the

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.416
European continent which is

00:01:21.683 --> 00:01:24.419
happening today in Ukraine, we

00:01:24.686 --> 00:01:28.390
have to be interested in

00:01:28.657 --> 00:01:29.157
limiting this war and ending

00:01:29.391 --> 00:01:29.891
this war.

00:01:30.826 --> 00:01:31.827
That is why this factor should

00:01:32.094 --> 00:01:33.862
unite us.

00:01:34.129 --> 00:01:34.629
Russia is an aggressor.

00:01:37.366 --> 00:01:39.167
Russia should not be on the

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:39.668
sovereign Ukrainian territory.

00:01:41.603 --> 00:01:44.439
It should go away, not with

00:01:44.706 --> 00:01:48.310
force but to retreat itself, to

00:01:48.577 --> 00:01:49.177
respecting the international

00:01:49.311 --> 00:01:49.811
law.

00:01:50.679 --> 00:01:52.781
It shouldn't be occupying the

00:01:53.181 --> 00:01:54.049
nuclear power plants because it

00:01:54.316 --> 00:01:54.850
is a threat to the whole of the

00:01:55.183 --> 00:01:55.683
world.

00:01:57.486 --> 00:01:59.655
I'm talking about zaporizhzhia

00:01:59.921 --> 00:02:00.421
power plants.

00:02:01.657 --> 00:02:04.359
That is the risk, and other

00:02:04.626 --> 00:02:06.528
countries --

00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:08.797
all of them, despite the

00:02:09.197 --> 00:02:12.100
geopolitical differences, we

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:13.201
have to be interested in peace.

00:02:15.737 --> 00:02:17.306
From the it's offering T to the

00:02:17.572 --> 00:02:18.307
territorial integrity to the

00:02:18.573 --> 00:02:19.073
end of this war.

00:02:19.207 --> 00:02:23.211
&gt;&gt; Under what conditions would

00:02:23.245 --> 00:02:24.513
you be willing to speak

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.280
directly with Vladimir Putin?

00:02:27.482 --> 00:02:33.221
&gt;&gt; Translator: And I think that

00:02:33.422 --> 00:02:35.223
today we don't have any

00:02:35.424 --> 00:02:36.258
circumstances to talk to the

00:02:36.525 --> 00:02:40.028
Russian president because he

00:02:40.295 --> 00:02:42.898
doesn't hold his word.

00:02:43.231 --> 00:02:43.731
We don't have any confidence in

00:02:43.965 --> 00:02:44.465
him.

00:02:46.802 --> 00:02:48.070
And he killed thousands of

00:02:48.337 --> 00:02:51.907
people in order to discuss

00:02:52.174 --> 00:02:54.376
resolution of war as a whole,

00:02:54.643 --> 00:02:56.311
and configuration of this

00:02:56.578 --> 00:02:57.078
diplomatic decision.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.682
Not military, but diplomatic

00:03:01.249 --> 00:03:01.817
decision in order to do that,

00:03:02.084 --> 00:03:02.584
Russia should leave our

00:03:02.751 --> 00:03:03.251
territory.

00:03:04.419 --> 00:03:06.488
After that, we have to join the

00:03:06.755 --> 00:03:11.493
diplomatic battles in order to

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.427
do that.

00:03:12.694 --> 00:03:15.263
We can find any format with our

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:15.930
partners just after that.

00:03:16.131 --> 00:03:18.533
&gt;&gt; What does the endgame,

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.300
mister president, look like?

00:03:20.569 --> 00:03:21.269
How do you define victory in

00:03:21.303 --> 00:03:21.803
this war?

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:24.539
&gt;&gt; Translator: We will have

00:03:24.806 --> 00:03:25.306
victory.

00:03:28.377 --> 00:03:33.615
I think that victory we'll end

00:03:33.882 --> 00:03:35.751
up with the understandable

00:03:36.017 --> 00:03:37.519
security decisions for many

00:03:37.786 --> 00:03:38.553
years to come, and I am sure

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:43.625
after this war there will be

00:03:43.892 --> 00:03:47.596
more understandable situations

00:03:47.863 --> 00:03:49.698
in the European continent and

00:03:50.465 --> 00:03:52.467
more stable situations on the

00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:53.602
European continent, and Russia

00:03:53.869 --> 00:03:54.403
will not be able to threaten

00:03:54.669 --> 00:03:56.638
any other countries fighting

00:03:56.905 --> 00:03:57.405
for their freedom and

00:03:57.572 --> 00:03:58.072
Independence.

00:04:00.575 --> 00:04:02.611
If Russia's troops will not

00:04:02.878 --> 00:04:05.480
leave Ukrainian territory, war

00:04:05.747 --> 00:04:07.949
will be raging in Ukraine, in

00:04:08.216 --> 00:04:09.518
Europe, on and on, that is why

00:04:09.785 --> 00:04:11.920
at any point, there will be

00:04:12.187 --> 00:04:14.656
another war which will lead to

00:04:14.923 --> 00:04:16.191
the third World War and we

00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:16.958
totally understand that.

00:04:19.327 --> 00:04:22.798
Number one, they have to leave

00:04:23.331 --> 00:04:24.331
Ukraine.

00:04:25.667 --> 00:04:26.768
They should either be pushed

00:04:27.335 --> 00:04:29.938
out of Ukrainian territory or

00:04:30.205 --> 00:04:31.440
negotiate an agreement with

00:04:31.706 --> 00:04:32.206
other partners.

00:04:32.441 --> 00:04:33.909
They have to leave our

00:04:34.176 --> 00:04:34.743
territory and then only then we

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:35.610
can talk about diplomacy.

00:04:36.211 --> 00:04:44.753
Now, we have to say if we will

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:45.554
leave it it will be calm before

00:04:45.821 --> 00:04:46.321
another storm.

00:04:47.456 --> 00:04:48.757
&gt;&gt; Do you believe, mister

00:04:49.024 --> 00:04:50.492
president, that Ukraine can win

00:04:50.759 --> 00:04:51.460
this war this year, 2023?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.797
&gt;&gt; Translator: It all depends

00:04:56.064 --> 00:05:00.502
