00:05:00.769 --> 00:05:01.369
material and military support.

00:05:04.005 --> 00:05:08.877
The longer it will take, the

00:05:09.377 --> 00:05:12.581
less motivation the fighters

00:05:12.848 --> 00:05:15.650
will be without any supplies of

00:05:15.917 --> 00:05:17.586
weaponry.

00:05:17.853 --> 00:05:21.790
That is why the motivation will

00:05:22.057 --> 00:05:22.958
evade because if we don't give

00:05:23.391 --> 00:05:25.560
people weapons they cannot go

00:05:25.827 --> 00:05:27.696
into a fence and if you wait,

00:05:27.963 --> 00:05:29.698
if you wait and wait, the

00:05:29.965 --> 00:05:30.966
victory will come later.

00:05:31.967 --> 00:05:32.467
But I am not doubting this

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:33.167
victory.

00:05:34.469 --> 00:05:34.969
It only depends on time.

